Reset your #{config.product_name} password

<div>Hi #{user.firstname},</div>
<br>
<div>We received a request to reset the password for your #{config.product_name} account <b>#{user.login}</b>.</div>
<br>
<div>Enter this code on the password reset page to choose a new password:</div>
<br>
<div style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 6px;">#{otp_code}</div>
<br>
<div>The code is valid for #{otp_expiry_minutes} minutes.</div>
<br>
<div>Closed the page already? You can also click the link below (or copy and paste the URL into your browser) to change your password:</div>
<br>
<div><a href="#{url}">#{url}</a></div>
<br>
<div>If you don't want to reset your password, please ignore this message. Your password will not be reset.</div>
<br>
<div>Your #{config.product_name} Team</div>
